epo.\" \"Pin the eligibility JWKS URL in config, and show the proxy allowlist, redirect/IP controls and block alerts.\" \"Allow only the outside destinations the task needs.\" \"E07\"\n# B10\nc B10.1 yes k8s/deployment.yaml:76 \"clinic-agent@sha256:b81f3c0e9d2a4756c8e1f0a3b2d4c6e8f0a1b3c5d7e9f1a2b4c6d8e0f2a4b6c8\" \"Checked every image: field (Deployment line 76, CronJob line 143) and both Dockerfile FROM lines; all use @sha256.\" \"Deployment, CronJob and Dockerfile bases are pinned by digest.\"\nc B10.2 unknown .github/workflows/deploy.yml:67 '--certificate-identity \"https://github.com/northbay-clinics/clinic-agent/.github/workflows/ci.yml@refs/heads/main\" \\' \"\" \"Signature is verified in the deploy workflow with a pinned identity and issuer (deploy.yml:66-68). No admission policy (Kyverno, policy-controller) is in the repo; the namespace only enforces Pod Security. A cluster-level admission policy may exist outside it.\"\nc B10.3 no .github/workflows/deploy.yml:66 'cosign verify \"$REPO@$DIGEST\" \\' \"\" \"Only the signature is verified. Provenance is generated in CI (ci.yml:67) but nothing checks builder, source repo, build type or externalParameters (no verify-attestation).\"\nc B10.4 unknown \"\" \"\" \"\" \"No admission policy in the repo, so mode, namespace scope and no-match deny cannot be read.\"\nc B10.5 yes .github/workflows/ci.yml:71 \"cosign-release: v2.6.2\" \"Both pins checked: ci.yml:71 and deploy.yml:60 are v2.6.2; no other cosign install.\" \"Cosign is pinned at 2.6.2 in CI and deploy.\"\nit B10 gap medium \"Deploy checks the image signature but never checks build provenance fields, and no admission policy is in the repo.\" \"Add cosign verify-attestation for builder, source repo, build type and externalParameters, and an enforcing admission policy.\" \"Check provenance fields such as the builder, source repository, build type, and the parameters set from outside the build\"\n# B11\nc B11.1 yes k8s/deployment.yaml:92 'drop: [\"ALL\"]' \"Read all four securityContexts: pod-level runAsNonRoot and seccomp RuntimeDefault (lines 67-74, 135-140) plus container allowPrivilegeEscalation false and drop ALL (86-94, 152-157). No init or sidecar containers. Namespace enforces restricted (line 6).\" \"Pods and containers meet the restricted baseline; the reminder container inherits runAsNonRoot and seccomp from its pod.\"\nc B11.2 yes Dockerfile:10 \"FROM gcr.io/distroless/nodejs22-debian12:nonroot\" \"Final stage is distroless nonroot with only node_modules, dist and config copied; no shell, curl or package manager installed in it.\" \"Distroless final image.\"\nc B11.3 yes k8s/deployment.yaml:88 \"privileged: false\" \"Searched manifests for hostPath, docker.sock, hostNetwork true, hostPID true, hostIPC true; the Deployment sets all host namespaces false (lines 63-65).\" \"No privileged mode, host mounts or host namespaces.\"\nc B11.4 yes config/tools.allowlist.yaml:6 \"- tool: ehr__find_patient\" \"Searched src/ for child_process, eval, exec(, spawn and code-interpreter tools; none (only RegExp.exec). The allowlist has no code-execution tool.\" \"The agent runs no model-written code.\"\nit B11 likely_pass high \"Pods meet restricted settings and the final image is distroless with no host access.\" \"Probe host access at runtime (recipe B11).\"\n# B12\nc B12.1 yes src/agent/loop.ts:14 'readFileSync(join(ROOT, \"prompts/system.md\"), \"utf8\")' \"Searched src/ for fetch, database or flag lookups of prompts or rules; prompts are read from files copied into the image (Dockerfile:17).\" \"Prompts come from the reviewed build.\"\nc B12.2 yes .github/CODEOWNERS:4 \"/prompts/\" \"Read CODEOWNERS: prompts, config, release, infra, k8s, .github, src/tools, src/control and src/audit need agent-platform-leads; the rest of src falls under the * dev team with 2 required reviews (github.tf:26).\" \"Prompt, config and harness paths have code owners.\"\nc B12.3 yes .github/workflows/deploy.yml:37 \"environment: ${{ inputs.emergency\" \"deploy.yml is workflow_dispatch only, but both environments restrict branches (github.tf:45-48, 64-67), require a named reviewer, and the workflow annotates the deployment with git sha and release (deploy.yml:75-79). No other deploy path in the repo.\" \"Production deploys run through a protected environment and record the commit.\"\nc B12.4 yes infra/terraform/github.tf:19 \"allows_force_pushes\" \"Read github_branch_protection main: force pushes and deletions off, enforce_admins true, signed commits, linear history.\" \"Force-push and deletion are blocked on main.\"\nit B12 likely_pass medium \"Prompts and harness are versioned, owned, and deployed through a protected environment.\" \"Verify branch protection and environment rules are applied in GitHub.\"","description":"Record B09-B12 answers"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2033,"cache_read_input_tokens":251194,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2033},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be046cb2-a615-4b99-9b5b-9574ded4eee7","uuid":"c94e49e2-0c6e-4433-9fdf-47e26c653d31","timestamp":"2026-10-02T15:26:48.896Z","request_id":"req_011CfdeLnZXUJFpUCm9YayQg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Q8DvRG584DHaL3qoXGv2sA":{"command":"cd /private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-repeat-_3kdytd7 && . ./h.sh\n# B09\nc B09.1 unknown k8s/deployment.yaml:189 \"app: egress-proxy\" \"\" \"NetworkPolicy is default-deny and allows only DNS, the platform egress proxy and the EHR /28. The destination allowlist itself lives in the platform proxy, outside this repo (deployment.yaml:160-161 only describes it).\"\nc B09.2 yes k8s/deployment.yaml:193 \"ipBlock: { cidr: 10.60.12.0/28 }\" \"Read all eg