rd: invalid SMS payload (line 57), unknown number (61), and the web chat 401, 400 and 404 returns (webchat.ts:24,36,40,45). Run, tool, denied, failed and reminder paths do carry all six fields.\"\nc A02.3 yes src/audit/recorder.ts:14 \"traceparent: z.string().regex(\" \"Checked that every writer spreads ctx.identity() (loop.ts:33, executor.ts:42, reminders.ts:37), which sets traceparent (identity.ts:110).\" \"traceparent is a field of the audit record itself.\"\nc A02.4 no src/routes/webchat.ts:43 'const tenantId = (req.headers[\"x-clinic-id\"] as string | undefined) ?? claims.clinic_id;' \"\" \"The audit tenantId comes from RunContext, which the web chat builds from a caller-supplied x-clinic-id header ahead of the verified token claim.\"\nit A02 gap medium \"Audit tenant can come from an unprotected header, and refusals before a run are not recorded.\" \"Take the tenant from the verified token only, and audit pre-run refusals with the six fields.\" \"every action records the accountable party, operational owner, tenant, agent-type-id, agent-instance-id, and trace context\" \"A04\"\n# A03\nc A03.1 no src/agent/identity.ts:24 '.filter((f) => f.endsWith(\".txt\"))' \"\" \"The type id hashes only prompts/*.txt, so prompts/system.md, the system prompt, is not part of it. Image digest, harness version and sha, models and three config files are included.\"\nc A03.2 no src/agent/identity.ts:24 '.filter((f) => f.endsWith(\".txt\"))' \"\" \"The extension filter skips system.md; release/manifest.json and the MCP server list are not hashed either. A changed system prompt keeps the same type id.\"\nc A03.3 yes src/config.ts:49 'export const AGENT_MODEL = \"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\";' \"Searched src/ and config/ for aliases, env overrides and -latest; both models are dated constants (config.ts:49-50) and the manifest marks them pinned_snapshot (release/manifest.json:21,30).\" \"Dated snapshot ids, no alias or env fallback.\"\nc A03.4 yes src/agent/identity.ts:25 \".sort();\"