ommands, and HTML output is escaped for its context.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Search for SQL, shell, and HTML built from generated output (`execute(f`, `+ query`, `shell=True`, `exec(`, `innerHTML`, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, `|safe`). 2) Check for parameters, argument lists, and context escaping. 3) Answer no if any query or command is string-built, uses `shell=True` or `sh -c` with model input, or HTML is unescaped.\",\n          \"met\": \"yes\",\n          \"evidence\": \"src/routes/webchat.ts:57\",\n          \"quote\": \"return reply.send({ reply: out.text, handoff: out.handoff !== null, runId: ctx.runId });\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"Grepped src/ for SQL, shell, child_process, innerHTML and string-built commands; none. Output goes out as JSON text or an SMS body.\",\n          \"note\": \"No SQL, shell or HTML is built from model output.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"R03.4\",\n          \"check\": \"Redacted audit evidence is kept rather than discarded.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Find redaction code and audit logging. 2) Check redacted records are written to an audit store. 3) Answer no if redaction drops the whole record, or the evidence is discarded instead of kept.\",\n          \"met\": \"no\",\n          \"evidence\": \"src/audit/recorder.ts:91\",\n          \"quote\": \"if (DROP_KEYS.has(k)) continue;\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"\",\n          \"note\": \"Redaction drops fields and masks values on the way to the model, and the audit event for a tool run (executor.ts:89) stores neither the redacted result nor a reference to it.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"red_flags_found\": [],\n      \"violates\": [\n        \"Remove secrets and limit sensitive data before tool output, debug output, or responses reach the model, outside recipients, or normal logs\"\n      ],\n      \"also_affects\": [],\n      \"summary\": \"Raw tool results, including patient contact data, are logged before redaction.\",\n      \"next_step