d only per run, not per action.\",\n          \"met\": \"yes\",\n          \"evidence\": \"src/tools/executor.ts:48\",\n          \"quote\": \"context: d.contextSize,\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"Checked every audit write in src/: tool events (executor.ts base), model.decision (loop.ts:69), peer.call and payment.refund (eligibility-check.ts:34,51) and reminder.sent (reminders.ts:43) carry context. intent.classified and run.* events are not tool or model actions and carry none.\",\n          \"note\": \"Each tool action record carries the context size of its deciding model call.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"R07.2\",\n          \"check\": \"Each value is labeled measured, estimated, or unavailable, and a missing value is stored as unknown, never as zero.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Find where context size is recorded. 2) Check a label of measured, estimated, or unavailable, and how missing values are stored. 3) Answer no if there is no label, or a missing value defaults to `0` (`or 0`, `?? 0`, `.get(..., 0)`).\",\n          \"met\": \"yes\",\n          \"evidence\": \"src/agent/context-size.ts:38\",\n          \"quote\": \"tokens: null, status: \\\"unavailable\\\"\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"Read context-size.ts:29-47: failures give tokens null with status unavailable, never 0; the reminder job also records null/unavailable (reminders.ts:43). cachedInputTokens uses ?? 0 at line 44 when the provider omits the cache field; the total itself is always from reported usage.\",\n          \"note\": \"Values are labelled measured, estimated or unavailable; missing is null.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"R07.3\",\n          \"check\": \"The count comes from a stated method that handles cached input and compaction, not a copied per-call billing total.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Find how context size is counted. 2) Check a stated method covers cached input and compaction. 3) Answer no if it copies `usage.input_tokens` or a bi