e budget signal passed to model calls (loop.ts:61) and tool.invoke (executor.ts:86), to EHR callTool (ehr-mcp.ts:95) and to payments, SMS and eligibility fetches.\",\n          \"note\": \"The watcher aborts in-flight calls through the shared abort signal within a 2 s poll.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"R11.4\",\n          \"check\": \"The stop also closes open tool streams, subscriptions, and background tasks.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Find streams, subscriptions, and background tasks (`asyncio.create_task`, goroutines, websockets, SSE). 2) Check the stop handler closes them. 3) Answer no if any is left open, detached, or untracked.\",\n          \"met\": \"unknown\",\n          \"evidence\": \"src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts:65\",\n          \"quote\": \"sessions.set(clinicId, client);\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"\",\n          \"note\": \"EHR MCP sessions are cached for up to 4 minutes and not closed when a run is halted; whether they hold open streams is not visible here.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"R11.5\",\n          \"check\": \"Only named operator identities can set the stop control.\",\n          \"verify\": \"1) Find who can set the stop (auth on the endpoint, IAM on the flag store). 2) Answer no if any authenticated user or service can set it with no named operator list. Answer unknown if access lives outside this repo.\",\n          \"met\": \"no\",\n          \"evidence\": \"infra/terraform/iam.tf:44\",\n          \"quote\": \"\\\"dynamodb:UpdateItem\\\",\",\n          \"counter_search\": \"\",\n          \"note\": \"A named operator role exists (iam.tf:60-86, SSO on-call group), but the agent's runtime role can also write the control table, so not only named operators can set the stop.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"red_flags_found\": [],\n      \"violates\": [\n        \"The agent's credentials must not be able to change it.\"\n      ],\n      \"also_affects\": [\n        \"B02\"\n      ],\n      \"summary\"